  m_Name: Architect Archibald
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.TrueEncounterData
  vendorName: Architect Archibald
  offerText: Allow me to install my masterwork indoor fountain in your living quarters.
    It requires an extraordinary amount of floor space, but the soothing ambiance
    is simply transcendent.
  acceptResultText: The massive stone fountain dominates the room. The cascading
    water sounds like pure heaven, washing all of your earthly stress away entirely.
  rejectResultText: Archibald calls your taste boring but you don't agree with him.
    You look inside of your house and it it fills your heart with peace.
  acceptedDelayedText: The poorly engineered fountain ruptures. A tidal wave of water
    destroys your electronics and triggers an electrical fire, leaving you coughing
    on thick smoke.
  rejectedDelayedText: 
